<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves down FIM 589 mln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves down FIM 589 mln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to November 22 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to November 15 SPFC :</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 36,951	 37,541</p>
<p> Money market intervention    10,461	 10,461</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		5,985	  5,982</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,271	  2,274</p>
<p> Total assets		     64,420	 64,240</p>
<p>In the previous week, to November 15, reserves rose by 97 million markka.    --Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
